explain_en="A supplier page is useful when a buyer can match a drawing to a sentence. The sentence names the part number, the condition, and the limit. Translation may change word order. It may not invent a second limit, drop the unit, or replace the part number with a marketing name. English stays at the site root and Chinese stays under /zh/, with reciprocal hreflang and x-default on the English URL. Those signals point at the pages. They do not forgive a mismatched specification.",
explain_zh="供应商页面有用，是因为采购能把图纸对上正文里的一句话。这句话要写出零件号、条件和限值。翻译可以改语序，不可以另造一个限值、丢掉单位，或把零件号换成营销名称。英语在站点根目录，中文在 /zh/，hreflang 互相指向，x-default 放在英文 URL。这些信号只是指向页面，不能原谅规格对不上。",
how_en="Before you compare traffic, compare six fields: company name, part number, specification including the unit, application, the claim with its condition, and whether the buyer question is answered, partial, or uncovered in that language. A Chinese page that shortens the operating range is partial even when the template looks finished.",
how_zh="比较流量之前，先比较六个字段：公司名、零件号、带单位的规格、应用、带条件的说法，以及该语言里买家问题是已回答、部分回答还是未覆盖。中文页把工作范围写短了，即使模板看起来完整，覆盖仍是部分回答。",
depth_en="In-language links should stay inside the language the reader is using. A Chinese paragraph that only points at the English drawing makes the Chinese URL depend on another language for the actual limit. That is a discovery problem and an answerability problem together. An orphan translation listed only in a sitemap is still hard to use.",
depth_zh="语言内的链接应留在读者正在使用的语言里。中文段落只指向英文图纸时，中文 URL 要靠另一种语言才能看到真正的限值。这同时是发现问题和可回答性问题。只出现在站点地图里的孤立译文，仍然难用。",
discover_en="Evidence for the limit is the drawing, the datasheet, or the standard named beside the sentence. Each language needs a working link to that evidence. Citation readiness here means a reader can tell which part the sentence describes. It is not a promise that any answer product will quote the page.",
discover_zh="限值的证据是句子旁边点名的图纸、数据表或标准。每种语言都需要一个打得开的证据链接。这里的引用就绪度，是读者能判断句子说的是哪个零件。它不是任何回答产品会引用该页的承诺。",
example_en="Teaching example, not a customer story. A brake-hose page in English states a pressure limit and a temperature range next to part number BH-240. The new language version keeps the headline and drops the temperature range. A buyer asking which hose matches a stated under-hood temperature gets a fluent page and the wrong constraint. The repair restores the range on that URL, links the drawing in the same language path, and re-audits. Nothing in that loop is a ranking forecast.",
example_zh="这是教学示例，不是客户故事。英文制动软管页在零件号 BH-240 旁边写了压力限值和温度范围。新语言版本保留标题，删掉了温度范围。买家问哪根软管对应某个发动机舱温度时，看到的是通顺的页面和错误的约束。修复是在该 URL 上补回范围，在同一语言路径链上图纸，然后复审。这个循环不是排名预测。",
checks_en=["Read the part number and the unit aloud on the English and Chinese URLs.","Confirm the safety limit survived translation, including the condition.","Check reciprocal hreflang among the live canonicals, with x-default on English.","Follow one in-language link from the family page to the part page."],
checks_zh=["在英文和中文 URL 上读出零件号和单位。","确认安全限值连同条件一起留在译文里。","检查线上规范 URL 之间的 hreflang 是否互相指向，x-default 在英文。","从系列页沿一条同语言链接走到零件页。"],
filing_en="On an automotive part page, the entity is the part number, not the campaign line.",
filing_zh="在汽车零件页上，实体是零件号，不是宣传句。",
