topic_en="reviewing a generated localization draft against the specification",
topic_zh="用规格核对生成式本地化草稿",
title_en="A generated localization draft is not the specification",
title_zh="生成的本地化草稿不是规格本身",
desc_en="A chat draft can propose wording. It cannot be allowed to change a number, a unit, or a product name. Mika Visibility does not promise citations.",
desc_zh="对话草稿可以提议措辞，但不能被允许改数字、单位或产品名。Mika Visibility 不承诺引用。",
blurb_en="Review every number in a generated draft against the page that owns the fact.",
blurb_zh="生成草稿里的每个数字，都要对照拥有该事实的页面。",
short_en="A generated localization draft is a proposal for wording, not a second source of product facts. Publish it only after a person checks the product name, the numbers, the units, and the exclusions against the page that already owns those facts.",
short_zh="生成的本地化草稿是措辞提议，不是第二套产品事实来源。只有在有人把产品名、数字、单位和排除项对照已经拥有这些事实的页面核对之后，才能发布。",
explain_en="Generative tools draft from whatever text they are given and from patterns in training. They do not know which sentence on your site is the specification. If the draft smooths a limit into a stronger claim, the page now states something the datasheet does not. Mika Visibility treats that as an evidence problem on the GEO Health track. It does not treat a fluent draft as proof, and it does not claim that ChatGPT, Gemini, or any other product will cite you.",
explain_zh="生成式工具根据你给它的文字和训练里的模式起草。它不知道你网站上哪一句才是规格。如果草稿把限值说成更强的承诺，页面就在陈述数据表里没有的话。Mika Visibility 把这看成 GEO 健康轨道上的证据问题。它不把通顺的草稿当成证据，也不声称 ChatGPT、Gemini 或任何其他产品会引用你。",
how_en="Keep one owner URL for the fact in each language. The reviewer compares company name, product name, specification, application, and the condition attached to any claim. Question coverage stays honest: answered, partial, or uncovered. A draft that sounds complete while omitting the exclusion is partial.",
how_zh="每种语言为该事实保留一个负责的 URL。审阅者比较公司名、产品名、规格、应用，以及任何说法所附的条件。问题覆盖保持诚实：已回答、部分回答或未覆盖。听起来完整、却漏掉排除项的草稿，仍是部分回答。",
depth_en="Do not paste the draft over the HTML and call the job done. The published page has to contain the checked sentence in text, not only inside a chat log or a screenshot. Internal links in that language should point at the datasheet with anchor text that names the document.",
depth_zh="不要把草稿盖到 HTML 上就当完成。发布的页面必须用正文写上核对过的句子，而不是只留在对话记录或截图里。该语言的内部链接应该用点名文档的锚文本指向数据表。",
discover_en="Hreflang still only marks the alternates you actually publish. A generated page that is not yet a real URL should not be added to the sitemap. x-default stays on the English URL. None of these tags promise inclusion in an answer surface.",
discover_zh="hreflang 仍然只标注你真正发布的对照页。还不是真实 URL 的生成页面，不应放进站点地图。x-default 留在英文 URL。这些标记都不承诺进入某个回答界面。",
example_en="Teaching example, not a measured result. A valve page says the seal is suitable up to a stated temperature and not for a named solvent. A draft translation keeps the temperature and drops the solvent exclusion. The fix is to reject that sentence, restore the exclusion, and re-audit the live HTML. The example names no customer and no score.",
example_zh="这是教学示例，不是测量结果。阀门页写密封件适用于某个温度，并且不适用于某种溶剂。翻译草稿保留了温度，删掉了溶剂排除项。修复是拒绝那句话，补回排除项，并复审线上 HTML。示例不点名客户，也不给分数。",
checks_en=["Diff the draft against the owner page for every number and unit.","Reject any sentence that adds a claim the datasheet does not make.","Publish the checked sentence in HTML text.","Leave hreflang and the sitemap for URLs that already exist."],
checks_zh=["把草稿里的每个数字和单位与负责页面对照。","拒绝数据表没有的新增说法。","把核对过的句子发布在 HTML 正文里。","hreflang 和站点地图只留给已经存在的 URL。"],
filing_en="A chat transcript is not evidence. The evidence is the specification the live page still agrees with.",
filing_zh="聊天记录不是证据。证据是线上页面仍然与之相符的规格。",
limit_en="Reviewing a generated draft does not guarantee search rankings or a citation in ChatGPT, Gemini, AI Overviews, or any other answer product. Mika does not sell that placement.",
limit_zh="审阅生成草稿，不保证搜索排名，也不保证被 ChatGPT、Gemini、AI Overviews 或任何其他回答产品引用。Mika 不出售这种位置。",
q1_en="What is a generated localization draft allowed to be?",
q1_zh="生成的本地化草稿可以被当成什么？",
q2_en="Why is a fluent draft not the specification?",
